<h3 id="api" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#api"><span>API</span></a></h3>
<h4 id="search-props" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#search-props"><span>Search Props</span></a></h4>
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>属性</th>
<th>说明</th>
<th>类型</th>
<th>默认值</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>defaultField</td>
<td>搜索字段的key</td>
<td>string</td>
<td></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>model <strong>(v-model)</strong></td>
<td>表单数据对象，组件内部触发change事件后，会自动修改model相关属性的值。</td>
<td>object</td>
<td></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>searchText</td>
<td>搜索字段的value，支持v-model:searchText (老的名字是searchText还兼容)</td>
<td>string</td>
<td></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>searchField</td>
<td>搜索字段的key</td>
<td>string</td>
<td></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>fields</td>
<td>搜索字段可选项（默认选中第一个）</td>
<td>Array&lt;<a href="#searchfield">SearchField</a>&gt;</td>
<td>[]</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>placeholder</td>
<td>搜索框占位文案（优先级低于 SearchField 内的占位文案）</td>
<td>string</td>
<td>'请输入'</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>selectStyle</td>
<td>传入fields后生效，对search组件中的select增加style属性</td>
<td>object</td>
<td>-</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
